### 📚 4-LEVEL PROGRESSIVE LEARNING PATH

**CRITICAL INSIGHT:** Users can't start conversations without vocabulary. Progressive path ensures everyone can begin.

```
LEVEL 1: VOCABULARY ACQUISITION (FR → AR)
├── AI speaks French
├── Teaches 10-20 words per theme
├── User translates FR → AR
├── Flashcards + spaced repetition
└── Goal: Build 300-500 word base

LEVEL 2: COMPREHENSION (AR → FR)
├── AI gives simple Arabic sentences
├── User translates to French
├── Verify understanding
└── Goal: Recognize and understand Arabic

LEVEL 3: ASSISTED CONVERSATION (Mixed FR/AR)
├── AI speaks Arabic + French help if needed
├── User responds in Arabic (errors OK)
├── Gentle corrections
└── Goal: Dare to speak Arabic

LEVEL 4: PURE IMMERSION (100% AR)
├── Natural Arabic conversation
├── No French help (unless requested)
├── Subtle corrections
└── Goal: Conversational fluency
```

