### Subtitle System Summary

**Levels with subtitles:**
- ✅ Level 1 (Vocabulary): ON by default, toggleable
- ✅ Level 2 (Comprehension): OFF by default, toggleable
- ✅ Level 3 (Conversation): ON by default, toggleable
- ❌ Level 4 (Immersion): Disabled completely

**Benefits:**
- Absolute beginners can understand AI responses
- Confidence booster for vocabulary learners
- Gradual weaning off subtitles as they progress
- User control (can turn off when ready)

**Best Practices:**
- Subtle styling (not distracting)
- Natural translations (not literal)
- Quick toggle access
- Respect user preferences

### Adaptive Progression
```typescript
// Automatic level adjustment based on performance
function evaluatePerformance(user_id: string): Promise<Level> {
  const last10Conversations = await getRecentConversations(user_id, 10);
  
  const metrics = {
    errorRate: calculateErrorRate(last10Conversations),
    vocabularyComplexity: analyzeVocabularyUsed(last10Conversations),
    responseTime: calculateAverageResponseTime(last10Conversations),
  };
  
  if (metrics.errorRate < 10% && metrics.vocabularyComplexity > 70%) {
    return 'advanced';
  } else if (metrics.errorRate < 30% && metrics.vocabularyComplexity > 40%) {
    return 'intermediate';
  }
  return 'beginner';
}
```

